<h2 dir="auto">Your projects, remembered</h2>
<p dir="auto">The projects you tick in the dashboard's sidebar are kept from one opening to the next, even after a restart. The Dashboard card in the menu bar panel opens on that same selection; clicking a project in the panel still opens the dashboard on that project.</p>
